The player must now navigate through hostile territory, evading angry satyrs and seeking a way to escape. Along the way, they witness the outbreak of war between the orcs and satyr, their diplomatic efforts having backfired spectacularly.
As they flee, the player must deal with the consequences of their words, facing the guilt of igniting conflict and seeking redemption through subsequent actions in the game.

